{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31368","headline":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼作 · 薛蒙","name":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"左绵江上楼，五马此销愁。\n暑退千山雪，风来万木秋。\n邅回犹刺郡，系滞似维舟。\n即有徵黄日，名川莫厌游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}